": "#ff008c", "widgets_values": ["audio/audio_minimax_music3", "mp3", "V0"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 67, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "format"}, {"widget": {"name": "format.quality"}, "name": "format.quality", "label": "format.quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "SaveAudioAdvanced", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#ff9ec8", "size": [210, 106], "pos": [2790, 930], "id": 35, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.31.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioAdvanced"}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax Music 3\n\n由 MiniMax 推出的音乐生成模型，可创作结构稳定、音质出色的完整歌曲，最长可达 5 分钟。生成由两个输入驱动：**Caption**（结构化音乐描述：风格、情绪、人声、编曲）和 **Lyrics**（歌词，通过 `[intro]` `[verse]` `[chorus]` `[bridge]` `[outro]` 标签控制歌曲结构）。\n\n### 参数\n\n| 参数         | 描述                                                         |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Caption      | 音乐描述。分三部分撰写——全局元数据 → 人声细节 → 编曲。描述越具体，生成结果越接近预期。 |\n| Lyrics       | 歌词 + 段落标签。标签是唯一可执行的结构指令；歌词文本本身只用于传达情绪。 |\n| max_duration | 目标歌曲时长（秒），默认 120 = 2 分钟；模型支持最长约 300 秒 / 5 分钟。歌曲越长，耗时和显存占用越高。 |\n| seed         | 生成用的随机种子。固定 seed 可复现同一首歌；更改 seed 可得到不同的版本。 |\n| 模型文件     | 扩散模型 / 文本编码器 / VAE。                                |\n| Tiled decode | 以重叠分块方式解码音频 VAE，可大幅降低显存占用——适合低显存 GPU 生成长歌曲。速度略慢，分块边界有轻微接缝风险；高显存 GPU 上建议关闭以获得最佳音质。 |\n\n### Prompt 编写指南\n\n官方提示词写作Skill [Music Caption Rewriter 技能见这里](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Music3)\n\n官方歌曲示例网站<https://minimax-ai.github.io/music3-demo/>"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax Music 3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [373.92193603515625, 526.48779296875], "pos": [878.1943359375, 931.0452880859375], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [170, 70], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [2490, 810], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 58, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 29, "backgroundAlpha": 0, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "时长（秒）", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#1eff00"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [258.3772277832031, 99.45912170410156], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [2760, 790], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 60, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 47, "backgroundAlpha": 0, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "保存音乐", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#1eff00"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "seed", "links": [71, 72], "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "size": [240, 106], "pos": [2450, 1410], "widgets_values": [452321235138160, "randomize", null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "id": 55, "type": "easy seed", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy seed"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [170, 70], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [2480, 1010], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true, "allow_interaction": true}, "id": 59, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 29, "backgroundAlpha": 0, "lineHeight": 1.4, "te